Faceplate artwork
-----------------
The shell background started from the author's generated reconstruction
`assets/fx-50fh-ii-generated-transparent.png` (the file the upstream CSS
already references). Before hosting on this site, the visible markings
「CASIO」, 「fx-50FH II」, 「SUPER-FX PLUS」 and 「H.K.E.A.A. APPROVED」
were removed from that image and replaced with neighbouring metal texture.
The Casio product photograph was never used.

Removing those marks does not make this page an official Casio product,
or an HKEAA-approved examination device.

「CASIO」, 「fx-50FH II」 and 「SUPER-FX PLUS」 are trademarks of
CASIO Computer Co., Ltd., and are mentioned here only to record what was
removed.

Disclaimer (unofficial / not an exam device)
--------------------------------------------
This is an unofficial web simulator for practice. It is intended to
follow the key sequences of the fx-50FH II family for HKDSE maths
practice, but:

- It is not an official Casio calculator.
- It is not an HKEAA-approved examination device.
- It must not be used in place of a physical approved calculator in
  an examination.
- Important results should be checked on a physical approved calculator.

